{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-13T05:00:00Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 生成式 AI 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_51b342f359c37e1a71af385f6b9469d4f0c1dcba8a74024c6d65e671996500be","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-new-ai-copilot-helps-engineers-design-better-struc-0-babb1d6956/","observation_id":"obs_babb1d695637283d5ca3646f8300aeecbe29c83848d74c59fb63eb8c9b884bb8","published_at":"2026-11-13T05:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"MIT 团队提出了一种“人在回路中”的拓扑优化系统：算法生成结构时，由机器学习快速标出设计师可能需要调整的区域，让人边设计边反馈。它希望兼顾计算效率、结构性能、制造可行性与工程师对结果的掌控感。","title":"New AI “copilot” helps engineers design better structures"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_75652dc861592c234e2fae4d15983948199915ef11c45d74b7e69306b21913aa","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-blogs_podcasts-optimizing-cost-per-task-and-proving-agent-roi-on--0-409a77b0b1/","observation_id":"obs_409a77b0b17a5148c50fa2d34fd8e289467f415901180490ea46c922f91886bd","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:43:19Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这套方法不再只看模型的 token 单价，而是按完整任务核算成本，并纳入分词效率、输出冗长度、代理循环次数和推理开销。它还通过人工基线、对照实验和五维评分卡，衡量智能体相对人工的表现与投资回报。","title":"Optimizing cost per task and proving agent ROI on Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_bc15a0787a1dbcaf6550bdacd92eb21eb5aa279a241eb7